Clawd desktop app and clock firmware

The app (app/, crates/, integrations/, tools/) and the clock firmware's own code (clock/) are
written for this project. The firmware is licensed WTFPL (clock/firmware/platformio.ini); it
builds on the Arduino ESP8266 core, Adafruit GFX/ST7789 and ArduinoJson under their own
licenses.

Third-party material this repository carries, and every app release ships inside the app:

- clock/firmware/src/features/clawd/clawd_fonts.h: bitmap glyphs generated from Anthropic's
  fonts (the .otf/.ttf files themselves are not in this repository).
- clock/firmware/data/clawd.pak and the style packs (clock/firmware/styles/*.pak): Clawd
  animations, from Anthropic's Clawd artwork.
- clock/firmware/data/desk.pak: rendered from the clawd-on-desk artwork (All Rights Reserved,
  personal use). The source SVGs are not in this repository.

These belong to their owners and are included only so a Clawd clock can show them; they are
not licensed under the project's terms. If you own any of it and want it removed, open an
issue.

The tray icon is drawn in code (app/src/tray.rs).

Claude, Claude Code and Clawd are trademarks of Anthropic. This project is
not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic. It reads your own Claude Code
login on your own computer to ask Anthropic's usage endpoint for your usage;
the token never leaves your machine except to api.anthropic.com.
